 # Changelog
 
+## 1.6.0 (2026-11-15)
+
+- `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee` assigns an open or in-progress ticket to an agent, or unassigns it.
+- Every ticket has an `assignee` (`null` when unassigned). `GET /tickets` filters by `assignee`.
+- The assigned agent is notified. The command line lists each ticket's assignee.
+
 ## 1.5.0 (2026-11-15)
 
 - `POST /tickets/import` bulk-creates tickets (`{"tickets": [...]}`), all of a batch or none, at most 5000.
